WEBVTT

01:33.530 --> 01:35.801
(Adapted from the web novel "Waiting for You in a City")

01:35.861 --> 01:38.161
(Fireworks of My Heart)

01:38.230 --> 01:41.131
(Episode 25)

02:18.270 --> 02:19.411
Salute.

02:19.610 --> 02:23.640
- Thank you for your hard work. - Thank you for your hard work.

02:23.710 --> 02:26.510
(Selfless contribution to disaster relief on the front lines)

02:39.290 --> 02:40.890
(Natural disasters are merciless, but there's love in this world)

02:45.170 --> 02:47.730
(Natural disasters are merciless, but there's love in this world)

02:47.800 --> 02:49.501
(Thank you, angels in white)

02:59.281 --> 03:00.181
(Thank you, firefighting warriors. Thank you, love has no borders)

03:00.251 --> 03:04.281
(Good thing you're here)

03:13.131 --> 03:14.561
(Firefighter)

03:51.830 --> 03:53.330
- Bye. - Bye.

04:08.450 --> 04:12.321
(Caring for people, selfless contribution at the front line)

05:09.111 --> 05:13.450
(How's your wound?)

05:13.510 --> 05:16.621
(Much better. Get some rest too.)

05:16.681 --> 05:19.220
(How's your wound?)

05:19.291 --> 05:25.291
(Much better. Get some rest too.)

05:26.491 --> 05:30.561
(I'm already done resting.)

05:30.631 --> 05:33.030
(What are you doing? You're not working, are you?)

05:33.100 --> 05:38.241
(What are you doing? You're not working, are you?)

05:38.301 --> 05:40.571
(I'm recovering.)

05:50.280 --> 05:56.660
(Do you want to meet up?)

05:56.720 --> 05:59.590
(Yes.)

06:06.371 --> 06:07.030
Come on out then.

06:49.340 --> 06:50.280
Have you been waiting for a long time?

06:50.611 --> 06:51.280
I just arrived.

07:00.150 --> 07:00.921
Why are you smiling?

07:02.321 --> 07:03.191
Nothing.

07:08.931 --> 07:09.760
Where are we going?

07:10.600 --> 07:11.330
Let's watch a movie.

07:12.131 --> 07:13.030
Sure.

07:14.671 --> 07:15.470
Where are we watching it?

07:16.071 --> 07:16.770
Qifeng Road.

07:17.840 --> 07:18.501
Sure.

07:21.811 --> 07:22.811
Why are you smiling again?

07:23.941 --> 07:24.840
"Sure, sure."

07:25.251 --> 07:26.311
You sound like a fool.

07:29.150 --> 07:30.520
Let's take the subway today.

07:30.881 --> 07:31.890
The traffic is bad.

07:32.520 --> 07:33.191
Sure.

07:33.950 --> 07:34.621
"Sure, sure."

07:34.691 --> 07:35.720
You sound like a fool.

08:00.481 --> 08:01.450
The card is broken.

08:16.931 --> 08:20.530
(Fire hydrant)

08:25.200 --> 08:25.871
What's the matter?

08:26.571 --> 08:28.840
This is a perfect interpretation of a math problem.

08:29.541 --> 08:30.340
What problem?

08:33.811 --> 08:36.051
Two parallel lines can intersect.

08:39.551 --> 08:40.720
At a certain time,

08:41.551 --> 08:42.490
a certain place,

08:42.821 --> 08:43.691
a certain point.

08:47.691 --> 08:48.661
It's a fake proposition.

08:49.261 --> 08:50.730
The reason they can intersect...

08:51.630 --> 08:53.600
is because they are not parallel lines.

08:57.441 --> 08:58.171
Song Yan.

08:59.041 --> 09:00.311
After the rescue operation,

09:00.441 --> 09:01.571
I've thought one thing through.

09:03.210 --> 09:04.880
Before, whenever I thought of you,

09:05.311 --> 09:06.281
of us,

09:07.480 --> 09:09.720
I would remember the 10 years we missed.

09:14.950 --> 09:15.990
But now I wonder...

09:16.960 --> 09:17.960
if our lives...

09:18.791 --> 09:20.490
are also like these tracks.

09:22.561 --> 09:23.661
We meet, we part.

09:24.460 --> 09:25.630
We separate, we reunite.

09:26.630 --> 09:28.970
So there's no need to dwell on what we missed out on.

09:29.571 --> 09:30.700
I just need to be with you...

09:31.271 --> 09:32.311
on the days...

09:32.840 --> 09:34.110
we meet again.

09:37.210 --> 09:38.411
Am I too fickle?

09:41.281 --> 09:42.051
Dr. Xu.

09:42.980 --> 09:44.051
You're being so sentimental...

09:44.681 --> 09:45.651
on your first subway ride?

09:47.120 --> 09:47.850
Let's go.

10:13.110 --> 10:16.521
Please stand clear and hold on to the handrail.

10:34.401 --> 10:35.071
Hello.

10:35.130 --> 10:35.901
- Hello. - One popcorn.

10:35.970 --> 10:36.700
All right.

10:38.171 --> 10:39.071
What would you like to drink?

10:40.210 --> 10:40.870
Cola.

10:41.641 --> 10:42.480
Two colas.

10:42.541 --> 10:43.480
All right. Please wait a moment.

10:46.710 --> 10:47.450
Grilled sausages.

10:47.681 --> 10:48.350
Spicy sticks.

10:48.850 --> 10:49.521
Potato chips.

10:50.181 --> 10:51.781
I don't eat much junk food anymore.

10:57.791 --> 10:58.490
What about this?

10:59.230 --> 11:00.761
I don't like chocolates either.

11:11.000 --> 11:12.110
Scan the code and pay here.

11:14.470 --> 11:15.141
All right.

11:15.210 --> 11:16.141
Enjoy the movie.

11:19.411 --> 11:20.181
Here.

11:22.321 --> 11:23.450
- Thank you. - Bye.

11:36.960 --> 11:37.630
Do you want some?

11:38.801 --> 11:39.470
You go ahead.

11:54.350 --> 11:55.080
Wait for me.

11:55.151 --> 11:56.051
I'll be right back.

12:30.120 --> 12:30.781
Okay.

12:31.651 --> 12:32.791
- I'm sorry. - It's okay.

12:32.850 --> 12:33.720
We'll be more careful next time.

12:33.850 --> 12:35.120
- Okay. - Enjoy the movie.

12:44.960 --> 12:45.771
It's an occupational hazard.

12:46.130 --> 12:47.571
The escape corridor is blocked, right?

12:47.700 --> 12:48.500
Yes.

12:53.411 --> 12:54.610
What happened when the movie started?

12:56.541 --> 12:57.641
I didn't watch it earlier.

12:59.411 --> 13:00.250
You didn't?

13:02.450 --> 13:03.720
What were you doing then?

13:08.391 --> 13:09.391
I was...

13:11.561 --> 13:12.761
watching what you were doing.

14:41.781 --> 14:42.551
We're here.

14:44.931 --> 14:45.701
Go inside.

14:56.110 --> 14:57.110
Do you want to come up?

15:01.150 --> 15:02.250
You haven't had dinner.

15:03.051 --> 15:04.250
Eat before you go.

15:06.291 --> 15:06.990
Do you know how to cook?

15:08.890 --> 15:09.721
Aside from rice,

15:10.020 --> 15:10.890
what do you have?

15:12.291 --> 15:13.530
There's a supermarket over there.

15:13.990 --> 15:15.091
They have everything.

15:17.730 --> 15:18.400
Let's go.

15:30.910 --> 15:31.880
Pork belly.

15:32.351 --> 15:33.610
This used to be your favorite.

15:40.890 --> 15:41.551
Marbled meat?

15:43.990 --> 15:45.360
Your tastes have changed a lot.

15:47.961 --> 15:49.801
Let's see what you like now and what you don't.

15:50.760 --> 15:51.561
Over the years,

15:51.831 --> 15:53.471
what's changed about you and what hasn't,

15:53.931 --> 15:55.071
I'll find out in one go.

15:55.640 --> 15:56.400
By the way,

15:56.471 --> 15:57.701
I don't eat spicy food anymore either.

15:58.400 --> 15:59.071
What about you?

15:59.270 --> 16:00.311
How have you changed?

16:03.240 --> 16:04.240
I can eat spicy food now.

17:21.720 --> 17:22.390
Is it good?

17:23.360 --> 17:24.091
It's very delicious.

17:24.791 --> 17:26.561
I remember you didn't know how to cook before.

17:27.960 --> 17:29.400
You weren't this tidy before either.

17:29.761 --> 17:31.001
You've changed a lot.

17:31.831 --> 17:32.771
I don't cook often.

17:33.331 --> 17:35.271
Sometimes, my uncle and aunt would travel far,

17:35.571 --> 17:36.370
so I cook for Zhai Miao.

17:39.210 --> 17:40.271
I've changed a lot too.

17:41.241 --> 17:42.281
I've become boring.

17:43.281 --> 17:44.041
Very boring.

18:28.751 --> 18:29.690
Have some tea.

18:30.091 --> 18:30.960
I've boiled some water.

18:38.400 --> 18:39.271
Don't you think...

18:40.331 --> 18:41.231
it's already late?

18:44.370 --> 18:45.271
What...

18:45.841 --> 18:46.841
do you mean?

18:48.910 --> 18:50.081
We watched a movie.

18:50.481 --> 18:51.541
We're done eating.

18:52.450 --> 18:53.410
What do we do after drinking tea?

19:00.450 --> 19:01.390
It's getting late.

19:03.021 --> 19:03.890
I'll get going.

19:39.690 --> 19:40.731
Do you still like me?

19:53.811 --> 19:54.571
I do.

19:56.710 --> 19:57.640
I regret it.

20:09.460 --> 20:10.491
Let's be together.

20:14.091 --> 20:15.761
I don't need you to do anything for me.

20:16.761 --> 20:17.700
I don't need you to promise...

20:17.761 --> 20:19.231
that you'll be on my side in the future.

20:20.400 --> 20:21.771
We've been through so much...

20:21.970 --> 20:22.870
and we still like each other.

20:23.470 --> 20:24.900
We've been through life and death too.

20:25.200 --> 20:27.011
We understand and love each other more than before.

20:27.610 --> 20:28.710
Let's be together then.

20:29.940 --> 20:30.981
We both have jobs...

20:31.041 --> 20:32.751
that we like and can work together on.

20:33.210 --> 20:34.511
If we had our own home,

20:34.751 --> 20:36.251
that would be the greatest thing.

20:36.920 --> 20:38.380
We should be together now.

20:38.880 --> 20:40.321
We can be together.

20:42.460 --> 20:43.360
Today,

20:46.690 --> 20:47.690
let's be together.

20:54.801 --> 20:55.870
What you're saying...

20:57.440 --> 20:59.071
doesn't sound like you at all.

21:05.610 --> 21:06.311
Do you...

21:09.011 --> 21:10.380
like me that much?

21:14.091 --> 21:14.791
Yes.

21:16.960 --> 21:18.021
I still like you.

21:19.561 --> 21:20.561
I like you a lot.

21:22.731 --> 21:24.031
After 10 years,

21:24.801 --> 21:25.761
even if your personality,

21:25.831 --> 21:27.430
preferences, and tastes have changed...

21:29.001 --> 21:30.001
or maybe we'll be sick of each other...

21:30.071 --> 21:31.470
in a week's time,

21:34.110 --> 21:35.170
now,

21:38.140 --> 21:39.041
let's be together.

21:53.960 --> 21:54.991
Call me when you've made a decision.

22:10.811 --> 22:11.640
Okay.

22:36.841 --> 22:37.870
Let's get married.

22:49.450 --> 22:50.251
Today.

22:51.150 --> 22:52.180
Right now.

22:53.890 --> 22:54.920
Let's be together.

24:09.761 --> 24:11.331
When did he start acting like this?

24:12.360 --> 24:13.370
Since coming back from Wangxiang,

24:13.430 --> 24:14.370
he's been acting like this.

24:16.001 --> 24:17.170
At first, we thought...

24:17.440 --> 24:18.870
he had a fight with his girlfriend.

24:19.470 --> 24:20.571
But then we found out...

24:20.640 --> 24:21.811
that he often wakes up in the middle of the night...

24:21.870 --> 24:23.041
and sits outside by himself.

24:23.741 --> 24:25.110
He sits there until dawn.

24:26.610 --> 24:27.710
Apart from Ge Zheng,

24:28.710 --> 24:29.981
who else is like this in our station?

24:30.450 --> 24:31.380
In that case,

24:31.450 --> 24:32.351
Tang Jie is the same way too.

24:32.950 --> 24:33.991
He can't sleep since he came back.

24:34.091 --> 24:35.291
He keeps saying...

24:35.991 --> 24:37.761
that if he had been just a little faster,

24:38.021 --> 24:39.731
he would have been able to save that little boy.

24:41.731 --> 24:42.531
What about Jiang Yi?

24:42.761 --> 24:44.001
Jiang Yi is fine.

24:44.061 --> 24:45.801
He's just been sleeping a lot lately.

24:46.271 --> 24:46.970
When he's not on duty,

24:47.031 --> 24:48.031
he keeps sleeping.

24:49.940 --> 24:51.700
I took a look at their questionnaires.

24:53.271 --> 24:54.311
It's PTSD.

24:55.410 --> 24:56.110
What SD?

24:56.940 --> 24:57.910
PTSD.

24:58.841 --> 25:00.851
Post-traumatic stress disorder.

25:02.081 --> 25:03.450
I've experienced it before.

25:04.081 --> 25:05.380
After the mission,

25:07.051 --> 25:07.991
I was shocked.

25:09.021 --> 25:09.821
For a while,

25:09.890 --> 25:11.160
I couldn't rest at all.

25:11.220 --> 25:12.791
I went to a doctor and he told me...

25:12.930 --> 25:14.031
that there was nothing I could do.

25:14.291 --> 25:16.061
I can only rely on the company of those around me.

25:16.460 --> 25:17.601
Besides that,

25:18.930 --> 25:20.731
only time can solve everything.

25:21.670 --> 25:23.241
Let's spend more time...

25:24.301 --> 25:25.170
with our comrades here.

25:28.640 --> 25:31.380
(China Fire and Rescue)

25:50.761 --> 25:51.630
What are you doing?

25:53.870 --> 25:54.531
Look.

25:55.930 --> 25:56.670
It's snowing.

25:57.670 --> 25:59.610
The yard at Uncle's house must be really beautiful.

26:02.370 --> 26:03.311
When you open the door,

26:03.910 --> 26:05.880
you can see a thick layer of snow.

26:06.910 --> 26:08.650
It's all over the roof and leaves.

26:14.890 --> 26:16.291
Do you like old-style houses?

26:18.021 --> 26:19.120
The one your family has?

26:20.130 --> 26:20.991
The one...

26:21.390 --> 26:22.430
where only one family lives.

26:24.561 --> 26:25.831
I like it.

26:26.470 --> 26:27.771
When I first went to my uncle's house,

26:27.831 --> 26:28.831
I told him...

26:29.231 --> 26:31.370
that I really like an old-style house...

26:31.801 --> 26:33.071
with a small yard.

26:35.670 --> 26:36.841
You don't remember, right?

26:46.491 --> 26:47.351
Go to work.

26:47.650 --> 26:48.551
You're going to be late.

26:58.761 --> 27:00.130
When I go to work later,

27:00.231 --> 27:02.200
will you be bored at home alone?

27:03.801 --> 27:04.571
It's okay.

27:05.241 --> 27:06.410
I'll rest at home in the morning.

27:06.710 --> 27:07.811
In the afternoon, I'm meeting a friend...

27:08.910 --> 27:09.581
A colleague.

27:12.680 --> 27:13.710
Is she a friend or a colleague?

27:15.351 --> 27:16.051
Both.

27:19.521 --> 27:20.991
Who is it? Do I know her?

27:22.551 --> 27:23.220
Yes.

27:23.561 --> 27:24.321
Li Meng.

27:27.130 --> 27:27.831
I see.

27:40.910 --> 27:41.910
Does she like you?

27:42.470 --> 27:43.210
Who?

27:46.351 --> 27:47.081
Li Meng.

27:51.781 --> 27:52.650
I don't think so.

28:01.561 --> 28:02.690
Do you like her then?

28:15.041 --> 28:15.910
What do you think?

28:22.051 --> 28:23.081
When do you get off work?

28:23.751 --> 28:24.581
I'll have dinner with you.

28:27.190 --> 28:28.390
I'm not sure.

28:28.791 --> 28:30.960
I might have emergency surgery tonight.

28:31.761 --> 28:32.821
I'll get off work late.

28:33.491 --> 28:34.491
Don't wait for me.

28:35.091 --> 28:35.791
All right.

28:36.430 --> 28:37.430
I won't bother you.

28:37.731 --> 28:39.031
Call me after work.

28:42.271 --> 28:42.940
Okay.

28:52.241 --> 28:57.950
(Yanbei Shilitai Fire and Rescue Station)

29:24.011 --> 29:25.440
Ge Zheng, let's eat.

29:25.811 --> 29:26.751
Yes, let's eat.

29:26.811 --> 29:27.680
There's cured meat today.

29:29.251 --> 29:30.781
I'm not going. I'm not hungry.

29:42.630 --> 29:43.301
Ge Zheng.

29:45.130 --> 29:45.860
What's wrong?

29:48.531 --> 29:49.271
I'm fine.

29:51.771 --> 29:52.601
If something's bothering you,

29:53.140 --> 29:53.910
don't keep it bottled up inside.

29:54.440 --> 29:55.110
Tell us.

29:56.071 --> 29:57.311
Then you'll feel better.

30:25.870 --> 30:27.741
A lot of new members who take part...

30:27.811 --> 30:29.011
in such a large-scale rescue operation...

30:29.880 --> 30:31.640
might possibly have...

30:31.710 --> 30:33.851
post-traumatic stress disorder.

30:34.210 --> 30:35.680
In our work lately,

30:35.751 --> 30:36.680
we have to pay careful attention...

30:36.751 --> 30:37.650
to this kind of situation.

30:37.720 --> 30:38.920
Report it to the brigade at once...

30:39.521 --> 30:40.650
to arrange for counseling...

30:40.991 --> 30:42.051
and give a happy ending...

30:42.390 --> 30:43.660
to this disaster relief.

30:43.720 --> 30:46.591
(Yanbei Fire and Rescue Brigade)

30:49.591 --> 30:50.660
Do you have any questions...

30:51.001 --> 30:52.261
about today's presentation?

30:55.801 --> 30:56.470
Go ahead.

30:57.801 --> 30:59.841
Regarding post-traumatic stress disorder,

30:59.910 --> 31:01.610
what are the common treatment methods?

31:01.670 --> 31:03.011
Can daily training...

31:03.081 --> 31:04.741
enhance the team member's emotional ability...

31:04.811 --> 31:05.541
to deal with this...

31:05.610 --> 31:07.150
to improve his mental strength...

31:07.210 --> 31:09.551
to cope with more complicated and difficult rescue operations?

31:12.981 --> 31:16.321
Currently, most of the treatment methods for PTSD include...

31:17.220 --> 31:19.291
medical treatment and psychological intervention.

31:19.360 --> 31:21.261
Based on our team member's situation,

31:21.331 --> 31:23.101
by reviewing...

31:23.160 --> 31:24.531
past rescue data,

31:24.601 --> 31:25.900
they can understand in advance...

31:25.960 --> 31:27.870
the difficulties and dangers one must face...

31:27.930 --> 31:29.071
in a large-scale rescue operation.

31:29.130 --> 31:30.601
This can help the new team members...

31:30.670 --> 31:31.601
adjust their mental states...

31:31.670 --> 31:33.311
in a timely and accurate manner...

31:33.370 --> 31:34.571
to improve their abilities to deal with stress.

31:38.640 --> 31:39.541
Does anyone else...

31:39.910 --> 31:41.110
have any questions?

31:41.180 --> 31:43.220
(Speaker's area)

31:57.031 --> 31:57.700
Go ahead.

32:00.970 --> 32:01.771
I...

32:03.370 --> 32:04.170
have no more questions.

32:08.311 --> 32:08.970
Okay.

32:10.541 --> 32:11.940
Let's have a recess for 10 minutes.

32:12.341 --> 32:13.180
Come back later.

32:28.231 --> 32:35.101
(Commendation Ceremony)

32:35.170 --> 32:36.231
Thank you for your hard work.

32:37.170 --> 32:38.200
In this disaster rescue,

32:38.771 --> 32:40.011
our medical team...

32:40.440 --> 32:42.011
performed outstandingly.

32:42.670 --> 32:44.041
They successfully performed...

32:44.110 --> 32:44.940
38 major surgeries...

32:45.281 --> 32:47.210
and 79 minor surgeries.

32:47.351 --> 32:50.281
They rescued 438 injured people.

32:50.581 --> 32:52.481
They're well-received by the locals.

32:58.821 --> 33:00.291
During this operation,

33:00.360 --> 33:02.430
some outstanding individuals also emerged.

33:02.761 --> 33:04.001
They have excellent medical skills...

33:04.561 --> 33:05.761
and they're benevolent.

33:06.130 --> 33:07.400
They always keep the lives...

33:07.470 --> 33:09.501
and safety of the local people in mind.

33:10.601 --> 33:12.400
Such medical professionals...

33:12.801 --> 33:13.841
deserve to be learned from...

33:13.910 --> 33:15.041
by each and every one of you.

33:16.071 --> 33:17.241
They also deserve to be recognized...

33:17.610 --> 33:19.011
by the hospital and society.

33:19.741 --> 33:20.610
Next,

33:21.410 --> 33:22.610
let's welcome...

33:22.811 --> 33:24.180
one of them.

33:24.450 --> 33:26.591
She was also chosen by the news media...

33:26.791 --> 33:28.791
as one of the top 10 touching people in the earthquake.

33:29.521 --> 33:31.491
Dr. Xu Qin from the Emergency Department.

33:31.591 --> 33:32.690
Please come and say a few words.

33:44.970 --> 33:45.700
Actually,

33:46.271 --> 33:48.311
I just did what I had to do.

33:50.011 --> 33:51.741
I was a rescued victim too.

33:54.610 --> 33:56.251
After I found out...

33:56.650 --> 33:58.321
that the woman was dead,

33:58.680 --> 33:59.880
I left.

34:07.160 --> 34:09.190
It was the firefighter who dug her up...

34:10.160 --> 34:11.801
and noticed that she was pregnant,

34:13.001 --> 34:14.231
so he called out to me.

34:16.171 --> 34:17.570
Thanks to his warning,

34:18.001 --> 34:19.700
I was able to save that baby in time.

34:20.840 --> 34:21.840
And he pulled me back...

34:23.070 --> 34:25.541
from the brink of making a huge mistake.

34:35.851 --> 34:36.921
At that moment,

34:39.590 --> 34:41.691
I realized my mistake ever since.

34:42.890 --> 34:44.131
As a doctor,

34:44.760 --> 34:47.001
this is a serious dereliction of my duty.

34:47.930 --> 34:48.631
It's also...

34:48.700 --> 34:49.370
Dr. Xu.

34:49.430 --> 34:50.271
That's enough.

34:50.340 --> 34:51.271
Go and get some rest.

34:53.611 --> 34:54.570
Since Dr. Xu...

34:55.041 --> 34:56.111
has been exhausted for many days,

34:56.171 --> 34:57.441
she's a little agitated.

34:58.010 --> 34:59.381
This is what happened.

34:59.441 --> 35:01.111
Dr. Xu and a firefighter...

35:01.351 --> 35:03.251
worked together to save a new life.

35:03.320 --> 35:04.120
Let's give her a round of applause.

35:26.811 --> 35:28.010
(Some thoughts and suggestions)

35:30.740 --> 35:33.450
(Keep warm. Drink more hot water!)

36:06.910 --> 36:08.351
Dr. Xu, you wanted to see me?

36:15.521 --> 36:16.351
Dr. Xu.

36:18.160 --> 36:19.620
I'll give this to you.

36:21.131 --> 36:22.131
Keep it as a souvenir.

36:32.870 --> 36:35.211
Over the past 10 days of earthquake rescue,

36:36.671 --> 36:38.740
I've seen an outstanding doctor.

36:44.921 --> 36:45.881
Keep up the good work.

36:50.620 --> 36:51.390
I will.

37:04.441 --> 37:05.171
What are you doing?

37:08.410 --> 37:09.510
Is this from the director?

37:11.410 --> 37:13.481
That old man is so biased.

37:14.450 --> 37:16.111
This was given to him by the Minister of Health...

37:16.180 --> 37:17.481
when he helped with an African rescue.

37:17.550 --> 37:19.081
He wears it every Doctors' Day.

37:19.151 --> 37:19.851
Is that so?

37:21.090 --> 37:22.720
Then I'll also wear it every Doctors' Day from now on.

37:24.361 --> 37:25.561
You're showing off, right?

37:27.791 --> 37:28.990
Keep up the good work, Dr. Yang.

37:30.961 --> 37:32.561
Keep a low profile, Dr. Xu.
